rgo tree -d`; `UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1 cargo test -p muse-adapter` then read the diff (only the new synthetic fixtures' snapshots may appear). Add a CHANGELOG entry under a new heading \"2026-09-13 — Owner round\" listing H1–H6 in one line each, and update `docs/02-app.md` where it describes the sidebar list (H1) and the status row (H6). Report per item: done / skipped-with-reason, test names, screenshot paths, gate output verbatim (last lines). When finished write the single word `done` to `/tmp/muse-owner-harness.done`.","branch":"owner-round-2026-09-13"},{"sessionId":"01a0875a-5099-7b30-8cb0-bca7325d8bd4","path":"/Users/latekaapi/.local/share/muse/sessions/2026/09/09/01a0875a-5099-7b30-8cb0-bca7325d8bd4/session.jsonl","status":"notLoaded","activeTurnId":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-09T18:07:18.196807Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-12T22:26:24.168622Z","workspaceRoot":"/Users/latekaapi/Projects/harness","providerId":"meta","modelId":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","turnCount":2,"forkedFrom":null,"name":"grove-azimuth","title":"Review fix on branch `wf-pending` (already checked out) in /Users/latekaapi/Projects/harness. Prefix shell commands with export PATH=\"/opt/homebrew/bin:$HOME/.cargo/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\". No library changes. No model turns from the app (screenshots via --replay only). Finding: docs/images/improve-silent-reasoning-dark.png shows the per-turn footer as two lines: \"muse-spark-1.3-contributor · 17.3 s · 59.2k tokens · 419 reasoning\" \"Thought silently · 419 reasoning\" The second line repeats the count and doubles the footer height. The intent (task D in docs/CHANGELOG.md) is one line. Change it so that, when a completed turn billed reasoning tokens but has no reasoning block, the EXISTING footer's reasoning segment reads \"419 reasoning, thought silently\" (same style, same line), and the separate line is removed. Turns with a visible reasoning block keep \"419 reasoning\" unchanged. Keep the pure decision function and its unit tests (adjust expectations), update docs/02-app.md's footer sentence and the task-D CHANGELOG entry, retake docs/images/improve-silent-reasoning-{dark,light}.png with the same --replay command the entry names, read them back to confirm one footer line. Run the four gates (build, test, clippy -D warnings, doc -D warnings). You are asked to commit the result on `wf-pending` with a message ending \"Co-Authored-By: Muse Code <noreply@meta.com>\". Report gates verbatim and the commit hash.","firstUserPrompt":"Review fix on branch `wf-pending` (already checked out) in /Users/latekaapi/Projects/harness. Prefix shell commands with export PATH=\"/opt/homebrew/bin:$HOME/.cargo/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$PATH\". No library changes. No model turns from the app (screenshots via --replay only). Finding: docs/images/improve-silent-reasoning-dark.png shows the per-turn footer as two lines: \"muse-spark-1.3-contributor · 17.3 s · 59.2k tokens · 419 reasoning\" \"Thought silently · 419 reasoning\" The second line repeats the count and doubles the footer height. The intent (task D in docs/CHANGELOG.md) is one line. Change it so that, when a completed turn billed reasoning tokens but has no reasoning block, the EXISTING footer's reasoning segment reads \"419 reasoning, thought silently\" (same style, same line), and the separate line is removed. Turns with a visible reasoning block keep \"419 reasoning\" unchanged. Keep the pure decision function and its unit tests (adjust expectations), update docs/02-app.md's footer sentence and the task-D CHANGELOG entry, retake docs/images/improve-silent-reasoning-{dark,light}.png with the same --replay command the entry names, read them back to confirm one footer line. Run the four gates (build, test, clippy -D warnings, doc -D warnings). You are asked to commit the result on `wf-pending` with a message ending \"Co-Authored-By: Muse Code <noreply@meta.com>\". Report gates verbatim and the commit hash.","branch":"main"},{"sessionId":"01a097b4-101d-75c0-b8c0-c43e09c46aea","path"